ig — while it lasts!<\/p>","text_style":"body","text_block_size":"small","show_text_background":true,"margin_top":25,"color_scheme_1":"option-2","hide_quick_view":false}}},"block_order":["text_1","title","product-meta","price","spacer_1","delivery_estimator","description","collapsible_tab_3","spacer_3","collapsible_tab_1","spacer_2","collapsible_tab_2","buy_buttons","complementary","share","spacer_4","collapsible_tab_4","spacer_5","collapsible_tab_5","spacer_6","text_2"],"settings":{"enable_full_width":false,"enable_sticky_info":true,"product_gallery_width":45,"gallery_layout":"slide","media_position":"left","media_fit":"contain","thumbnail_size":"large","image_zoom":"lightbox","hide_variants":false,"enable_video_looping":true,"quantity_selector":4,"color_scheme":"option-1","in_stock_background_color":"#ffa680","in_stock_color":"#1d1d1d","under_gallery":"second","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":76,"ignore_spacing":false}},"tabs_W7raYF":{"type":"tabs","blocks":{"tab_WtYm8b":{"type":"tab","settings":{"heading":"BTS Storage Tips","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/storageInfo.png","tab_image_width":500,"hide_image":false,"row_content":"<ul><li>Store kits in a <strong>cool, dry place<\/strong> away from sunlight.<\/li><li>Once opened, use the toppings immediately for best texture.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Shelf life:<\/strong> 6–9 months (varies by flavor).<br\/><\/li><li>Best served chilled with ice and your favorite milk (dairy or plant-based).<br\/><\/li><li>Vegetarian and made with globally sourced tea extracts.<\/li><\/ul><p>Fresh flavor starts with proper care — shake, chill, and sip happy.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style_secondary":false}},"tab_VEtGfU":{"type":"tab","settings":{"heading":"Nutritional Info","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/nutritional_info_v3.png","tab_image_width":500,"hide_image":false,"row_content":"<ul><li><strong>Energy:<\/strong> 207.9 kcal<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Carbohydrates:<\/strong> 41.6 g<br\/><\/li><li> <strong>Total Sugars:<\/strong> 33.3 g<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Protein:<\/strong> 1.7 g<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Total Fat:<\/strong> 3.8 g<\/li><li><strong>Saturated Fat:<\/strong> 2.8 g<\/li><li><strong>Trans Fat:<\/strong> 0 g<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Sodium:<\/strong> 31 mg<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>*Approximate values. Final nutrition may vary slightly based on preparation (water, milk, or plant-based alternatives) and toppings used.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style_secondary":false}},"tab_mi8Dw9":{"type":"tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Ingredients & Quality","tab_image_width":1000,"hide_image":false,"row_content":"<p>Discover what makes every BTS drink so special.<br\/><br\/>Each kit is crafted using <strong>premium tea extracts<\/strong>, <strong>natural flavor mixes<\/strong>, and <strong>real toppings<\/strong>, from chewy tapioca pearls to refreshing nata de coco.<br\/><br\/>All ingredients are <strong>100% vegetarian<\/strong>, carefully sourced, and blended under <strong>The Tea Planet’s<\/strong> quality standards to bring authentic café flavors straight to your home.<\/p><p>No artificial preservatives. No shortcuts, just real ingredients and real taste.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["tab_WtYm8b","tab_VEtGfU","tab_mi8Dw9"],"settings":{"tabs_style":"style-2","full_width":true,"color_scheme":"option-1","color_scheme_1":"option-2","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60,"ignore_spacing":true,"margin_spacing":"negative","margin_top":0}},"rich_text_xBBY4q":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_fY9C86":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<p>How to Make it<\/p>","heading_size":"large","heading_style":"default","heading_tag":"h2","highlight_option":"underline-hand","word_animation_color":"#272727"}},"text_fqtMzp":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"<p>Share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, make a